e":6,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":0.0561,"r5":-0.0878,"r1_spy":0.06,"r5_spy":-0.0807}}],"quotes":[{"c":"WCC 2018 Q3","e":"wcc","d":"2018-11-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David S. Schulz","x":"The construction end-market continues to be challenged by an extremely tight labor market in the presence of both inflationary and tariff related price pressures, which have increased cost for certain projects, but we are helping our customers navigate these headwinds.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q3-2018-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2018 Q3","e":"wcc","d":"2018-11-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David S. Schulz","x":"Ryan, our direct exposure to the tariffs that have been announced is low-single digit, that would be items that we are purchasing directly from those countries, in which there is now going to be the higher tariff rate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q3-2018-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2018 Q3","e":"wcc","d":"2018-11-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David S. Schulz","x":"It is clear that we are seeing the benefits of our margin improvement initiatives, while effectively pushing supplier price increases through to our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q3-2018-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2018 Q3","e":"wcc","d":"2018-11-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John J. Engel","x":"And then with all the price increases, clearly that put some -- creates a set of challenging conditions for them as they're bidding new projects, with record backlogs and labor shortages.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q3-2018-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2018 Q3","e":"wcc","d":"2018-11-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John J. Engel","x":"So, we'll continue to -- I think we have more opportunities to continue to streamline, let's say accelerate our working capital turns.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q3-2018-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2018 Q4","e":"wcc","d":"2019-01-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Dave Schulz","x":"The construction end market challenges continued to be driven by a tight labor market in the presence of both inflationary and tariff-related price pressures, which we have increased cost for certain projects.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/01/wesco-international-wcc-q4-2018-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2018 Q4","e":"wcc","d":"2019-01-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John Engel","x":"The tariffs obviously were not foreshadowed.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/01/wesco-international-wcc-q4-2018-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2018 Q4","e":"wcc","d":"2019-01-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dave Schulz","x":"We are pleased to see the benefits of our margin improvement initiatives, while operating effectively in a challenging environment marked by increased inflation and an unprecedented number of supplier price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/01/wesco-international-wcc-q4-2018-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2018 Q4","e":"wcc","d":"2019-01-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dave Schulz","x":"We are pleased with this result, given the unprecedented number and size of price increases that we experienced in 2018, which were over two-and-a-half times the number received in 2017.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/01/wesco-international-wcc-q4-2018-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2018 Q4","e":"wcc","d":"2019-01-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"David Manthey","x":"Beyond your day-to-day efforts in Lean and cost containment, are there any specific cost-cutting efforts that would lead you to a result?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/01/wesco-international-wcc-q4-2018-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2019 Q1","e":"wcc","d":"2019-05-02","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David Schulz","x":"Construction customers remain challenged by a tight skilled labor market in the presence of both inflationary and tariff related price pressures, which have increased costs for certain projects.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2019 Q1","e":"wcc","d":"2019-05-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John Engel","x":"Demonstrating the positive impact of our margin improvement initiatives and the effectiveness of passing through price increases from our supplier partners.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2019 Q1","e":"wcc","d":"2019-05-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David Schulz","x":"Again, I think that this is our continued progress against pushing through the supplier price increases and the organic margin initiatives that we've been implementing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2019 Q1","e":"wcc","d":"2019-05-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"John Engel","x":"You see that we reaffirmed our guide for the full year maintained that you know, well, that's our last being additive as Dave mentioned offset by increased FX headwinds when we gave the guide.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2019 Q2","e":"wcc","d":"2019-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David S. Schulz","x":"But we are seeing some project delays with industrial contractors due to budget constraints and uncertainty, partially caused by tariff-driven price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2019 Q2","e":"wcc","d":"2019-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John J. Engel","x":"The other thing we're hearing from our suppliers in those announcements that have occurred throughout the first half but particularly in Q2 is tariffs are being mentioned as kind of the driver or the cause or the trigger in approximately two-thirds of the announcements that went into effect in Q2.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2019 Q2","e":"wcc","d":"2019-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David S. Schulz","x":"The balance of the decline was driven primarily by the high number of supplier price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2019 Q2","e":"wcc","d":"2019-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David S. Schulz","x":"We are confident we are passing supplier price increases through to our customers but are experiencing the normal lag between when we receive price increases from suppliers and when we see the impact on our gross margin rate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2019 Q3","e":"wcc","d":"2019-10-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David S. Schulz","x":"Year-to-date the number of supplier price increases continued to exceed those seen in 2018 with tariff cited as a significant driver for approximately half of all increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2019 Q3","e":"wcc","d":"2019-10-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David S. Schulz","x":"Project activity levels remain active however we have seen some project delays with industrial contractors due to skilled labor constraints and overall uncertainty partially caused by tariff-driven price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2019 Q3","e":"wcc","d":"2019-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John J. Engel","x":"Close margin was under pressure and declined in the quarter driven by next and the time lag to pass through the record levels of supplier price increases to customers this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2019 Q3","e":"wcc","d":"2019-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David S. Schulz","x":"Regarding supplier price increases we are aggressively working to pass through increases to our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2019 Q3","e":"wcc","d":"2019-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John J. Engel","x":"This organizational change is part of a broader streamlining of our operating structure that I will discuss a little bit later in this call.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2019 Q3","e":"wcc","d":"2019-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John J. Engel","x":"These organization changes further streamline our operations and will help WESCO grow as a leaner more agile company.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2019 Q3","e":"wcc","d":"2019-10-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"John J. Engel","x":"…in our release earlier this morning based on our September year-to-date results and our view of the end markets we have narrowed the range for our full year outlook for sales growth operating margin and EPS while maintaining our outlook for free cash flow generation of at least 90% of net income.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2019 Q4","e":"wcc","d":"2020-01-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David S. Schulz","x":"Tariffs were cited as a significant driver for approximately half of all increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/30/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2019 Q4","e":"wcc","d":"2020-01-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John J. Engel","x":"Gross margin declined in the quarter, driven partly by business mix as well as the time lag required to pass through the higher levels of supplier price increases that we experienced last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/30/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2019 Q4","e":"wcc","d":"2020-01-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David S. Schulz","x":"Regarding supplier price increases, we are aggressively working to pass through increases to our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/30/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2020 Q1","e":"wcc","d":"2020-05-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John J. Engel","x":"Quite frankly, a lot of these activities started with the implementation of tariff.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2020 Q1","e":"wcc","d":"2020-05-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John J. Engel","x":"So when tariffs were implemented, a number of our supplier partners started looking at their global footprint and began to optimize their supply chains a bit differently given the tariffs that we're on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2020 Q1","e":"wcc","d":"2020-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John J. Engel","x":"As we have done in prior economic downturns, we are aggressively managing our business and have taken a series of cost reduction and cash management actions as outlined on this page.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2020 Q1","e":"wcc","d":"2020-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John J. Engel","x":"We are highly confident in exceeding our 3-year cost savings, sales growth and cash generation synergy targets communicated last month.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WCC 2020 Q2","e":"wcc","d":"2020-08-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John J. Engel","x":"…we have done in prior economic cycles, we aggressively managed our business and took significant cost reduction and cash management actions, which enabled us to achieve a decremental margin of only 10%, and generate exceptionally strong free cash flow of $140 million or 250% of adjusted net…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/13/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q2-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WCC 2020 Q2","e":"wcc","d":"2020-08-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John J. Engel","x":"We are both building on this early successes, and we remain highly confident in capturing the significant upside potential and exceeding our three-year cost savings, sales growth, margin expansion and cash generation synergy target.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/13/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q2-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WCC 2020 Q3","e":"wcc","d":"2020-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John J. Enge","x":"As we build on these early successes, we are increasingly confident in our ability to achieve significant upside potential and exceed our three-year cost savings sales growth, margin expansion and cash synergy targets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WCC 2020 Q3","e":"wcc","d":"2020-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John J. Enge","x":"We first communicated our three year cost savings sales growth, margin improvement and cash generation synergy targets back in March.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WCC 2020 Q4","e":"wcc","d":"2021-02-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David S. Schulz","x":"So clearly, we have seen what's going on within the current market, we know what's volatile and our expectation is that as we see those costs increases, we will continue to pass them through to our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/09/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WCC 2020 Q4","e":"wcc","d":"2021-02-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John J. Engel","x":"…clearly, we're now seeing I would say for first quarter of this year, if you look at supplier price increases that we are aware of, been informed of, and we also have obviously have knowledge of what the suppliers are intending on doing to some degree before everything is fully rolled…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/09/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WCC 2020 Q4","e":"wcc","d":"2021-02-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John J. Engel","x":"Our management team is now in place, and we've been able to streamline roles across functions for greater efficiency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/09/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WCC 2020 