th.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/06/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WCC 2021 Q1","e":"wcc","d":"2021-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John J. Engel","x":"…nine months since closing the deal, we continue to outperform market growth rates and have generated nearly $75 million in realized cost synergies, primarily from organizational redesign that deliver structural cost takeout and also from increased efficiencies and reducing staffing redundancies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/06/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WCC 2021 Q1","e":"wcc","d":"2021-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Dave Schulz","x":"We have increased our outlook for sales growth to a range of 4.5% to 7.5%, primarily due to the macroeconomic outlook, which has substantially improved since January.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/06/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WCC 2021 Q1","e":"wcc","d":"2021-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Dave Schulz","x":"We have increased our outlook for adjusted EBITDA margin to a range of 5.8% to 6.1%, primarily driven by the strong profitability this quarter and our increased target for synergy realization for the rest of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/06/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WCC 2021 Q2","e":"wcc","d":"2021-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David S. Schulz","x":"As we have indicated in the past, pricing on our project-based bids are generally honored by our suppliers, and we don't see the full impact of supplier price increase notifications.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/07/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WCC 2021 Q2","e":"wcc","d":"2021-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David S. Schulz","x":"This increase reflects the gross margin initiatives I discussed earlier, strong cost synergy realization and effective price/cost pass-through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/07/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WCC 2021 Q2","e":"wcc","d":"2021-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David S. Schulz","x":"Other headwinds to EBITDA in the quarter were higher benefit costs and the reversal of certain cost reduction actions we undertook in the prior year in response to the COVID pandemic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/07/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WCC 2021 Q2","e":"wcc","d":"2021-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"David S. Schulz","x":"We have increased our outlook for sales growth to a range of 10% to 13%, primarily due to the strong demand we have experienced in the first half of the year, execution of our cross-sell program, continued share gains and strong macroeconomic outlook for the remainder of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/07/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WCC 2021 Q2","e":"wcc","d":"2021-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"David S. Schulz","x":"We have increased our outlook for adjusted EBITDA margin to a range of 6.1% to 6.4%, primarily driven by the strong profitability this quarter, the expectation for continued sales growth and operating leverage in the second half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/07/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WCC 2021 Q3","e":"wcc","d":"2021-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David S. Schulz","x":"This increase reflects the gross margin initiatives I discussed earlier, effective price cost pass-through, strong cost synergy realization and operating cost leverage.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WCC 2021 Q3","e":"wcc","d":"2021-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David S. Schulz","x":"Finally, the temporary cost reduction actions taken in response to the COVID pandemic weren't reversed until October last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WCC 2021 Q3","e":"wcc","d":"2021-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David S. Schulz","x":"On the right side of the slide, we've outlined the total $300 million cost savings target by synergy type.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WCC 2021 Q3","e":"wcc","d":"2021-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"David S. Schulz","x":"For adjusted EBITDA margin, we've raised our outlook to the range of 6.4% to 6.5%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WCC 2021 Q3","e":"wcc","d":"2021-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"David S. Schulz","x":"These strong results have enabled us to increase our full year outlook for sales growth, adjusted EBITDA and adjusted EPS for the third time this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/wesco-international-inc-wcc-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WCC 2025 Q4","e":"wcc","d":"2026-02-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"John Engel","x":"Providing another proof point that WESCO is benefiting from the enduring secular growth trends of, number one, digitalization, that includes AI-driven data centers and automation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/wesco-wcc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WCC 2025 Q4","e":"wcc","d":"2026-02-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"David Schulz","x":"Growth was driven by customers accelerating the shift from analog to digital systems with AI-enabled data center deployments, amplifying demand for our next-generation security solutions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/wesco-wcc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WCC 2025 Q4","e":"wcc","d":"2026-02-10","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David Schulz","x":"As a reminder, our outlook does not include the impact of future pricing actions, including tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/wesco-wcc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WCC 2025 Q4","e":"wcc","d":"2026-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David Schulz","x":"Q4 price increase notifications were up over 125% in count year over year with the average increase in the mid-single-digit range.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/wesco-wcc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WCC 2025 Q4","e":"wcc","d":"2026-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David Schulz","x":"Through January, we continue to field a higher than average number of price increase notifications with the average increase in the mid-single-digit range.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/wesco-wcc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WCC 2026 Q1","e":"wcc","d":"2026-04-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Unknown Speaker","x":"We have a growing funnel of sales opportunities and we are bullish that we will benefit from AI-driven data center investments and other major power-related infrastructure projects over the long term.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/wesco-wcc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WCC 2026 Q1","e":"wcc","d":"2026-04-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Unknown Speaker","x":"AI-driven data centers and related investments from our customers remain a key driver of growth across several product categories and verticals.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/wesco-wcc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WCC 2026 Q1","e":"wcc","d":"2026-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Unknown Speaker","x":"On the tariff front, the overall impact to WESCO International, Inc. is not material.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/wesco-wcc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WCC 2026 Q1","e":"wcc","d":"2026-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"John J. Engel","x":"As a result, we are raising our full-year outlook for 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/wesco-wcc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WCC 2026 Q1","e":"wcc","d":"2026-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"John J. Engel","x":"I will now turn it over to him to take you through our excellent first-quarter results and raised full-year outlook in more detail.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/wesco-wcc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WCC 2026 Q2","e":"wcc","d":"2026-07-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Indraneel Dev","x":"As demand for power-intensive AI data center infrastructure continues to increase, Customers are engaging Wesco earlier in the lifecycle to help solve complex power and infrastructure challenges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/30/wesco-wcc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WCC 2026 Q2","e":"wcc","d":"2026-07-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Indraneel Dev","x":"And similarly, also on the inventory side, you know, as we invest more in digital transformation and now layering in AI, we have tools that we have never had before in terms of looking at our entire data lake and analyzing what can be done in terms of compressing that cycle.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/30/wesco-wcc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WCC 2026 Q2","e":"wcc","d":"2026-07-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Indraneel Dev","x":"As a result of our exceptional first half results, and ac